{"id":"323282b93f22ef06","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-effective-arithmetic-system.md","title":"Axiomatizable Arithmetic System in the Book’s Sense","display":"df-effective-arithmetic-system — Axiomatizable Arithmetic System in the Book’s Sense","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system","aliases":["92-df-effective-arithmetic-system"],"display":"df-effective-arithmetic-system — Axiomatizable Arithmetic System in the Book’s Sense","source":"第 V 章 p. 57；第 VII 章 pp. 88–89、93（PDF 74、105–106、110）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-effective-arithmetic-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-arithmetic-system — Axiomatizable Arithmetic System in the Book’s Sense"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 57；第 VII 章 pp. 88–89、93（PDF 74、105–106、110）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 为外部 c.e. 谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 为本地闭句集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axable}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Axable}_G\\)</span> 为下文定义的可证码集、可反驳码集与有效性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\nP_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash X\\},\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\nP_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash X\\},\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p. 57 以定理码集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 定义 axiomatizable；这里经有效编码译成 c.e.。它不要求原先给出的公理集合可判定。可证公式码与可证闭句码有常规有效互译：公式有效取全称闭包，闭包可证又可作全称消去，故在这套经典有限元数演算中两种有效性表述等价。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\">\\(R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\)</span> 也是 c.e.：给定句子码，计算其否定码并半判定可证性。这里没有把一般无限元数规则的裸证明检查视为可判定。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 p. 57；第 VII 章 pp. 88–89、93（PDF 74、105–106、110）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#},R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axable}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\nP_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash X\\},\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}&\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner\\mid\nX\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\ \\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"R_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}","display":false}],"bytes":2075,"backlinks":[{"id":"64779d4d642bf6b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]、[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]区分经典演算与有效性。"},{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"faf6841087a5303b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","69a2a133da01f9c9","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","90f32e29c9d553ed","51c43e0240787ebb"]}